      "message": "It had been getting reported, but I realized that that properties JSON object would be a good place to store the additional submodule diff data as well (like unchecked_out_submodules, deleted_submodules, new_submodules, etc.).\n\nUploaded a new patch set for the change.\n\nHere\u0027s a LED run for an ANGLE roll:\nhttps://ci.chromium.org/ui/p/chromium/builders/try.shadow/mac-rel/170/overview\n\nAnd the JSON it generated:\n```\n{\n    \"affected_files\": {\n        \"deleted_submodules\": {\n            \"first_100\": [],\n            \"total_count\": 0\n        },\n        \"first_100\": [\n            \"src/DEPS\",\n            \"src/third_party/angle\",\n            \"src/third_party/angle/src/libANGLE/Display.cpp\",\n            \"src/third_party/angle/src/tests/angle_end2end_tests_expectations.txt\"\n        ],\n        \"nested_submodules\": {\n            \"first_100\": [],\n            \"total_count\": 0\n        },\n        \"new_submodules\": {\n            \"first_100\": [],\n            \"total_count\": 0\n        },\n        \"submodule_files\": {\n            \"first_100\": [\n                \"src/third_party/angle/src/libANGLE/Display.cpp\",\n                \"src/third_party/angle/src/tests/angle_end2end_tests_expectations.txt\"\n            ],\n            \"total_count\": 2\n        },\n        \"total_count\": 4,\n        \"unchecked_out_submodules\": {\n            \"first_100\": [],\n            \"total_count\": 0\n        }\n    },\n    ... (some other stuff)\n}\n```\n\nAnd some PLX queries (also linked in the CL description):\nhttp://scripts/script_ce._5cc58a_54b3_47f2_a9cc_0dc5f3b0d5ff",
